  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Old College Try**: back after 45 archived shows (1158 days) [2]\n- **Genesis 30:3**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Song for Dana Plato**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **It's All Here in Brownsville**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Hebrews 11:14**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Isaiah 45:23**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Psalms 40:2, Deuteronomy 2:10, Enoch 18:14, Romans 10:9 [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2009-11-27.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 18 songs; 81 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Cotton, Enoch 18:14, Footlist/Song for Dennis Brown, Hast Thou Considered the Tetrapod, Psalms 40:2, band entrance/Hebrews 11:14 [1]\n- Owen Pallett joined the band onstage to play violin during this specific track [1]\n- Owen Pallett played piano on this song while touring with the Mountain Goats [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2009-11-27.aud.flac16**: taped by Thomas J Hartnett; transferred by Thomas J Hartnett; source: AUD [1]. Also: Audio captured via Zoom H2 built-in mics, then normalized and split using Sound Studio [1]",
